optmem-rs is a Rust reimplementation of the `memo` tool from OptMem by
Victor Taelin: https://github.com/VictorTaelin/OptMem

The OptMem design, command set, store format and the agent prompt text
printed by `memo init` and `memo` come from that project. It had no license
file when this port was published; rights in that original work remain with
its author. The MIT license in LICENSE covers only the Rust code written for
this repository.
